# Home screen names

The home screen labels are not the code names. When the user says these words, they mean these screens. Do not rename files, commands, or docs to match the labels.

| They say | Screen | Code and commands |
|---|---|---|
| Scan | Search | `search`, `SearchSetupScreen` |
| Launch | Publish | `publish`, `PublishScreen` |
| Countermeasures | Defense | `defense`, `DefenseScreen` |
| Download | Refresh snapshot | `snapshot`, `SnapshotScreen` |

Quit is still Quit.

"When I launch" means publishing lines. "Download" means refreshing the snapshot, not saving a file. "When I launch the app" means starting the program.
